# PROJECT: SCHOOL LMS WITH GEMINI AI

## 1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior full-stack software engineer, UI/UX designer, database architect, security engineer, and Google Gemini AI integration specialist.

Build a complete, functional, modern, responsive School Learning Management System (LMS) for a school.

The application must support four user roles:

1. Administrator
2. Teacher
3. Student
4. Parent

The application must include academic management, assignments, quizzes, examinations, report cards, attendance, announcements, user profiles, private messaging, group discussions, student–teacher communication, and AI-powered educational assistance.

IMPORTANT:
- Build a real application, not just a UI prototype.
- Implement working navigation, forms, authentication, database operations, and user permissions.
- Persist data using a real database.
- Integrate Google Gemini AI using a secure server-side implementation.
- Do not use fake data as a replacement for required backend functionality.
- Do not leave buttons that do nothing.
- Do not implement the entire system as one giant frontend component.
- Organize the project into maintainable components, pages, services, and backend functions.
- If a service requires configuration, implement the integration and clearly identify the required setup instead of pretending it works.
- Build the application in manageable stages while maintaining one consistent project.

